d problem...\n2 may have some benefit within special situation...\n1 intervention not stated...\n\nDirectly related: meeting logging mandate. So 4.\n\nNow produce output with evidence sentence then score.\n\nNeed format: For each subscale give \"<subscale>_evidence\" (one sentence) first and then \"<subscale>\" (integer). Probably as JSON? Return rating echoing its id exactly. Probably provide lines.\n\nLet's produce:\n\nid: P2197\noriginality_evidence: ...\noriginality: 1\n...\n\nEnsure one sentence evidence each.\n\nMake sure evidence sentence ends with period.\n\nProceed.\n\n",
